				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;about-me&#34;&gt;About Me&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Hi, I&amp;rsquo;m &lt;strong&gt;Emilio Jáñez&lt;/strong&gt; — a developer, cyclist, and curious mind based in Mexico City.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m passionate about cybersecurity, NLP, and open source. When I&amp;rsquo;m not in front of a terminal, I&amp;rsquo;m probably on my bike climbing some hill around CDMX.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;what-i-do&#34;&gt;What I Do&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;🛡️ Cybersecurity &amp;amp; ethical hacking (CTFs, writeups, pentesting)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;🗣️ NLP &amp;amp; AI projects, including indigenous language preservation&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;🚴 Road cycling and documenting routes across Mexico&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;🎨 Exploring tattoo art and biomechanical design&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;get-in-touch&#34;&gt;Get in Touch&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GitHub&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/Emilio-J4n3z&#34;&gt;github.com/Emilio-J4n3z&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a href=&#34;https://linkedin.com/in/emilinho&#34;&gt;linkedin.com/in/emilinho&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
